<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/NIOSH-ControlOntology#PersonalProtectiveEquipment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Personal protective equipment (PPE) includes clothing and devices to protect workers. PPE needs constant effort and attention (including proper use and training) from workers. Higher-level controls aren’t always feasible, and PPE might be needed in conjunction with other control measures. Least effective contols."@en .
